  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to AFROSAI-E Strategic Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the AFROSAI-E Strategic Plan 2025-2029 to strengthen the institutional capacity of tSupreme Audit Institutions (SAIs) in English-speaking Africa to produce quality and relevant audits, and contribute to greater transparency and accountability in the public sector. 
Focus areas are on ISSAI compliance; Governance of the institutions; Digitalisation and Competent people (HR). Capacity development in 26 countries, including Malawi, Mozambique, Somalia, Tanzania</narrative>
  </description>
